# {{APP_NAME}}

Generated by `aegis init`. This is a standard Maven project — open it
directly in IntelliJ IDEA, VS Code (with the Java extension), Eclipse, or
any IDE with Maven support. No special plugin or archetype is required.

## Build and run

```
mvn compile exec:java
```

Edit `application.yml` first — set `baseUrl` and, if the app needs a
login, `username`/`password`/`successUrlContains`. See AEGIS's own
`USAGE.md` for the full field reference, exploration strategies, and how
to write a plugin.

## Requirements

- Java 23+
- AEGIS installed to your local Maven repository (`mvn install` from the
  AEGIS project root) — a published Maven Central artifact is planned for
  Stage 6 ("Community Release") but isn't available yet.
